note: Entron - Three Levels of English (natural vocabulary)

note: Level 1 (existing)
define variable age as 18
display age

note: Level 2 (simple)
make score equal to 100
show score

note: Level 3 (natural)
let the total be 0
make the total 5 more
tell me the total

if the age is 18 or older
    say "Adult"
otherwise
    say "Underage"
end

say "Hello" 3 times

make a list of fruits: "Apple", "Mango"
add "Orange" to the list
tell me the first fruit

turn "hello" into uppercase
tell me the result